{"title":"CALIBURN","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUWELL CALIBURN is a leading brand in the vaping industry and in particular their Caliburn vape \u0026amp; KOKO range has been a huge hit across the globe. Check out all of their kits and accessories that we stock below! Discover the lastest products of Caliburn here!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-tenet-koko-18w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn Tenet KOKO 18W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Caliburn TENET KOKO 18W Pod System, featuring a 950mAh battery, aluminum-alloy housing, and works with Caliburn G\/G2 Pods and Coils. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell g replacement coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-empty-cartridge\" title=\"Caliburn G2 replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-replacement-coils\" title=\"Caliburn G2 replacement coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003cimg data-mce-fragment=\"1\" alt=\"uwell caliburn tenet koko infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/caliburn-tenet-koko-pod_Infographic.jpg?v=1684878329\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrafted from durable aluminum, the chassis of the Caliburn TENET KOKO Pod System offers a strong and protective chassis, safely encapsulating the 950mAh battery within. Utilizing coils and pods from the Uwell Caliburn G and G2 Series, the TENET KOKO is perfect for those that love portable pod system that deliver plenty of flavor.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Caliburn TENET KOKO 18W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 73.7mm by 50mm by 18mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 950mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage Output: 18W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Aluminum-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: Uwell Caliburn G\/G2 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Installation: Press-Fit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: Caliburn G\/G2 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn TENET KOKO\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn G2 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Caliburn G2 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Metal Lanyard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531606171703,"sku":"U Cali Tenet KOKO Pod System","price":4900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_tenet_koko_pod_system_-_grey.png?v=1741702501"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-koko-prime-15w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn Koko Prime 15W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn KOKO Prime Pod System, offering a 690mAh battery, magnetic decorative panels, and compatibility with the Caliburn G Pods and Coil Series. Constructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn KOKO Prime is ergonomic and portable, easily fitting in the hand, pocket, purse, or bookbag.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with a 2mL refillable pod from the Caliburn G, the Uwell Caliburn KOKO Prime uses the Caliburn G Coils to produce outstanding vapor and flavor with the 0.8ohm meshed coil and introduces a new 1.0ohm FeCrAl coil for those that are more flavor oriented and love the MTL aspect of vaping. Featuring an integrated 690mAh battery, the Caliburn KOKO Prime can be recharged via Type-C USB Port while providing long lasting power.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNOTE: Both the packaging have same contents in it.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell caliburn g replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell caliburn G coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: start;\"\u003e\u003cimg style=\"float: none;\" alt=\"uwell caliburn koko prime infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0573\/8709\/0059\/files\/Uwell_Caliburn_Koko_Prime_Infographic.jpg?v=1648648452\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell CALIBURN KOKO PRIME 15W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 68mm by 45.6mm by 16mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 690mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax. Wattage Output: 15W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Airflow Systems\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanyard Attachment Point\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Silicone Check Valve\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm UN2 Meshed-H Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm FeCrAl Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress-Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Flavor Testing Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen-Circuit Indication\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Power Indication\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOver-Time Indication\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB Type-C Cable\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn KOKO Prime\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.0ohm Caliburn KOKO Prime Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Caliburn Koko Prime (Normal - Basic Packaging)","offer_id":41531606663223,"sku":"U Cali Koko Prime Pod System (Normal - Basic)","price":3700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Caliburn Koko Prime (Vision - Latest Packaging)","offer_id":41531606695991,"sku":"U Cali Koko Prime Pod System (Vision - Latest)","price":3700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_koko_prime_-_all_colors.png?v=1741702517"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-koko-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Caliburn Koko Replacement Pods – 4 Pcs","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn KOKO Replacement Pods are designed for the Uwell Caliburn koko pod system Featuring a 2ml nic salt e-liquid capacity and an atomizer resistance of 1.2 ohm. Each KOKO re-fillable pod features a magnetic connection and fits smoothly into the housing. The housing that holds the pod in place has a side view window which allows users to casually check their juice level without removing the pod itself.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNote: The original Caliburn Replacement Pods are compatible with the KOKO device.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Specifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn KOKO Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml E-Liquid Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRe-Fillable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3.5mm Fill Ports\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Ports\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2 ohm Atomizer Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMinimum Fill Line\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGold Plated Contacts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Includes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eOne Pack of Four (4) 1.2 ohm Caliburn Pod.","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531606859831,"sku":"U Cali Koko Replace Pods - 4 pcs","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Uwell-Caliburn-Koko-Replacement-Pods.jpg?v=1741702523"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-koko-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn Koko Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003ePresenting the UWELL Caliburn KOKO Pod System, a finely crafted vaping pod system manufactured with a integrated 520mAh rechargeable battery, Caliburn pod compatibility, and can be concealed within the palm of the hand with ease. Constructed from high quality aluminium alloy, the chassis of the UWELL Caliburn KOKO is moderately impact resistant, safely housing the 520mAh rechargeable battery and sporting an exterior matte metallic finish. In addition, the Caliburn KOKO pod system is compatible with its namesake, the 2mL refillable Caliburn Pods, featuring a dual parellel 1.2ohm coil design that vaporizes eJuice or nicotine salts with ease, delivery delicious flavors and nicotine when needed. Furthermore, the shape and style of the Caliburn KOKO pod kit is much different, offering a more concealable shape and design for better portability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuy \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-koko-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn Koko Replacements Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn Koko Replacements Pods\u003c\/a\u003e from here.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUWELL Caliburn KOKO Pod System Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 520mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 11W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 3.2-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDirect Voltage Based Output\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 1.2-1.5ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminium-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Capacity Juice Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm KOKO Coil Resistance\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Flavor Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Drip Tip Doubles as Fill Port Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3.5mm Fill Port - Dual Ports\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMinimum Fill Line on Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProprietary Gold-Plated Magnetic Snap-In Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Mechanism Fault Diagnosis\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 UWELL Caliburn KOKO\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Caliburn KOKO Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531607744567,"sku":"U Cali Koko Pod System","price":3600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_koko_pod_system_-_black.jpg?v=1741702534"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-a2s-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Caliburn A2S Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn A2S Pods (4-Pack), featuring a 2mL capacity, side fill system, and an integrated 1.2ohm meshed coil for maximum flavor. Cross-compatible with the original Caliburn A2 Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2s-pod-system\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn A2s Pod System\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2S Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2-15w-pod-system\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn A2 Pod System\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2 Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn A2 Replacement Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell CALIBURN A2S Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm A2S Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with 0.9ohm A2 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of four (4)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531626881079,"sku":"U Cali A2S Replace Pods","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_a2_side_refilling_pod_-_accessories_-_box-min.png?v=1741703112"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-a2s-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn A2S Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Caliburn A2S Pod System, featuring an integrated 520mAh battery, 2mL side-filled pod capacity, and integrated 1.2ohm meshed coil. Cross-compatible with the original Caliburn A2 Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Links:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2s-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn A2S Replacement Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2S Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Caliburn A2S infographic\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/Uwell_Calibrun_A2S_Pod_Systes_-_Infographic_-min.jpg?v=1669758838\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable aluminum-alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn A2S Pod System delivers a highly portable form-factor that can easily be stored within the pocket, purse, or bookbag. Equipped with a 2mL pod, the Caliburn A2S refills via a silicone stoppered side fill system. Within the clear pod is an integrated 1.2ohm coil that delivers amazing flavor and vapor that will excite the taste buds, all from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts. Operating off a draw-activated firing mechanism, the Caliburn A2S is your next best vaping experience, packed into a powerful compact vape.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell CALIBURN A2S Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 110.1mm by 21.3mm by 11.7mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 520mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage Output: 15W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJuice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1.2ohm A2S Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with 0.9ohm A2 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn A2S Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 1.2ohm Caliburn A2S Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531626946615,"sku":"U Cali A2S Pod System","price":3400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_a2s_-_pod_system_-_black.png?v=1741703122"},{"product_id":"uwell-yearn-11w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Yearn 11W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell YEARN 11W Pod System is a sleek and compact pod system, integrating a 370mAh rechargeable battery, LED battery life indicator light, and is equipped with a slew of operational and hardware safeties and protections that will guard against failure when in use. Crafted from a zinc-alloy chassis, PC, and ABS materials, the YEARN Pod System has a quality heft to the weight, without weighing down the pockets or purse.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition, the integrated 370mAh rechargeable battery is spacious enough to provide ample power for vaping without the need for charging in between sessions. On the face of the YEARN Pod System is a LED Battery Life Indicator Light, relaying the remaining battery life via colored LED light. Furthermore, the YEARN Pod System is equipped with a bunch of circuit protections and performance safeties to ensure a stable, safe, and reliable vaping system. \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote: Uwell Yearn doesn't includes pods in kit.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003eUwell YEARN 11W Pod System Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 86.7mm by 20.2mm by 10.4mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 370mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax. Wattage Output: 11W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy \u0026amp; PC ABS Material Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJuice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIsolated E-Liquid Chamber Technology - Preserves Freshness of eJuice\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Flavor Testing Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Power Indication\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaping Overtime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlug 'n' Play Cartridge Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Black \u0026amp; Blue, Grey, Black \u0026amp; Violet, Black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nIncludes:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x YEARN Battery Body\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x User's Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1x YEARN Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531628126263,"sku":"U Yearn Pod System","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_yearn_11w_pod_system_-_default-min.jpg?v=1741703374"},{"product_id":"uwell-yearn-neat-2-12w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Yearn Neat 2 12W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell YEARN NEAT 2 12W Pod System, featuring a 520mAh Battery, an integrated 0.9ohm UN2-Meshed H Coil, and 2mL pod capacity. Constructed in a lightweight manner, the chassis is slim and compact, housing the 520mAh battery. Featuring no buttons, the YEARN NEAT 2 works off a draw-activated firing mechanism to reduce the chances of any auto-firing. Holding up to 2mL fill within the pod, the YEARN Neat 2 pods utilizes an integrated 0.9ohm UN2 Meshed-H coil to deliver outstanding flavor with the Pro-FOCS Max Flavor Technology.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell YEARN NEAT 2 12W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 102.5mm by 22.1mm by 11.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 520mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax. Wattage Output: 12W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLightweight Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.9ohm UN2-Meshed H Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Pro-FOCS Flavor Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen-Circuit Indication\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell YEARN NEAT 2 Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.9ohm UN2-Meshed H Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531629010999,"sku":"U Yearn Neat 2 Pod System","price":3560.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_yearn_neat_2_-_pod_system_-_black.png?v=1741703386"},{"product_id":"uwell-yearn-neat-2-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Yearn Neat 2 Replacement Pods","description":"Check out the Uwell YEARN NEAT 2 Replacement Pods, featuring a 2mL capacity, 0.9ohm integrated UN2 Meshed H Coil, and Pro-FOCS flavor technology.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell YEARN NEAT 2 Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.9ohm UN2-Meshed H Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Pro-FOCS Flavor Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003eMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.\u003cbr\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531629043767,"sku":"U Yearn Neat 2 Replace Pods","price":1400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_yearn_neat_2_-_refillable_pods_-_fecral_0.9_ohm.png?v=1741703391"},{"product_id":"uwell-yearn-replacement-pod-cartridges","title":"Uwell Yearn Replacement Pod Cartridges","description":"\u003cp\u003eWe asked Uwell to release refillable pod cartridges for the Uwell Yearn pod device because we love it so much and now they're here - a refillable (empty) alternative to the pre-filled pods for the Yearn.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Yearn has been our best selling closed pod device and now it's open to use with all your favourite liquids! Amazing, right?!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecs:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePacket of 4\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.5 ml Capacity with side fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.4 Ohm Resistance Cotton Vertical Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWe strongly suggest the use of 50\/50 PG\/VG salt based e-liquids for this device to ensure your pods don't burn out prematurely.\u003c\/strong\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531629076535,"sku":"U Yearn Replace Pod Cartridges","price":1250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-yearn-replacement-pod-cartridges-4-pack.jpg?v=1741703396"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-ak3-13w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn AK3 13W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Uwell Caliburn AK3 13W Pod System, featuring a 520mAh battery, 1.0ohm resistance, and operates off a draw and button activated firing mechanism. Constructed from durable aluminum, the Caliburn AK3 Pod System offers a slim and portable form factor and is easy to carry around in the pocket, purse, or bookbag. In addition, the Caliburn AK3 Pod System is capable of utilizing pods from the A3 Pod Series, holding up to 2mL within the confines of the refillable PCTG Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Caliburn AK3 13W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 67.5mm by 44.1mm by 12mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 520mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Range: 13W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 1.0ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Aluminum-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Dual-Activation - Button \u0026amp; Draw\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: Caliburn A3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Fill - Mouthpiece Cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Installation: Press-Fit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn AK3\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 1.0ohm Caliburn A3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Silicone Lanyard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531659943991,"sku":"U Caliburn AK3 Pod System","price":4100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_ak3_13w_pod_system_-_cyan.png?v=1741704483"},{"product_id":"uwell-sculptor-11w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Sculptor 11W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Sculptor 11W Pod System, featuring a 370mAh battery, 11W maximum output, and is equipped with a 1.2ohm mesh coil to deliver vapor.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-sculptor-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Sculptor Pods\"\u003eUwell Sculptor Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the Sculptor Pod System is visually striking but reliable, outputting delicious clouds of vapor at the slightest draw. In addition, the Sculptor Pod Kit has a lanyard attachment point to tether the Sculptor within arm's reach. Holding up to 1.6mL of eJuice or nicotine salts within the refillable pod, the Sculptor Pod System is great for beginners or advanced vapers alike.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Sculptor Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 77.1mm by 32.6mm by 15mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery: 370mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage: 11W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Zinc-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFiring: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 1.6mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill: Side Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil: Integrated 1.2ohm Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Sculptor Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 1.2ohm Sculptor Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Necklace\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531764572215,"sku":"U Sculptor Pod System","price":3900.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_sculptor_-_pod_system_-_bronze.png?v=1741709754"},{"product_id":"uwell-sculptor-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Sculptor Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Sculptor Pods (2-Pack), featuring a 1.6mL capacity, side fill system, and \u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1.2ohm\u003c\/strong\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eintegrated coil for delicious flavor and vapor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-sculptor-11w-pod-system\" title=\"Uwell Sculptor Pod System\"\u003eUwell Sculptor 11W Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Sculptor Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 1.6mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill: Side Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil: Integrated 1.2ohm Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of two (2)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531764834359,"sku":"U Sculptor Replace Pods","price":1149.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_sculptor_refillable_pod_accessories_box.png?v=1741709759"},{"product_id":"uwell-popreel-n1-pod-system","title":"Uwell Popreel N1 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out Uwell Popreel N1 Pod System, featuring an integrated 520mAh rechargeable battery, 2mL pod capacity, and includes an integrated 1.2ohm coil. Constructed from durable PC materials, the chassis is lightweight and portable, fitting neatly into the hand, pocket, or purse. Equipped with an integrated 520mAh battery, rechargeable via bottom microUSB port. Outfitted with a 2mL refillable pod, the integrated coil measures in at 1.2ohm and delivers exceptional flavor and vapor production from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salt. Operating off a draw-activated firing mechanism, the Popreel N1 Pod System is simple to use and is a great addition to any collection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0573\/8709\/0059\/files\/Uwell_Popreel_Infographic.jpg?v=1656106882\" al