k2-vision-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn GK2 (VISION) Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Caliburn GK2 Pod System, featuring a 690mAh battery, 18W output maximum, and utilizes both the G and G2 Coils for outstanding flavor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-empty-cartridge\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G2 Empty Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-coils\" title=\"UWELL Caliburn G Coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G2 Replacement Coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable aluminum-alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn GK2 is lightweight and squared to neatly fit within the hand. Adopting dazzling LED indicator lights and haptic vibrational feedback, the Caliburn GK2 Pod System is intuitive and responsive. Calling upon a 690mAh battery, the Uwell Caliburn GK2 can last throughout the day and is recharged via Type-C port. Holding up to 2mL of eJuice within the top filled pods, the Uwell Caliburn GK2 utilizes coils from the Caliburn G and G2 Coil Series to deliver amazing flavor and vapor from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Caliburn GK2 (Vision) 18W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 72.2mm by 46.6mm by 16.6mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 690mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Range: 18W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Aluminum-Alloy Chassis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: Caliburn G\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Installation: Press-Fit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: Caliburn G and G2\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHaptic Feedback\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrecision Airflow Adjustment\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Lights\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn GK2 (Vision) Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn G2 Cartridge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Caliburn G Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Caliburn G2 Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Lanyard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41652527759415,"sku":"U Cali GK2 (Vision) Pod System","price":4550.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_gk2_vision_pod_system_-_limpid_black.png?v=1746637969"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-gk2-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn GK2 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Uwell Caliburn GK2 Pod System, featuring an integrated 690mAh battery, 18W maximum output, and can utilize the Caliburn G \u0026amp; G2 Coil Series. Constructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the Uwell Caliburn GK2 is designed to be portable, while delivering delicious flavor and vapor. Holding up to 2mL of eJuice or nicotine salts, the Caliburn GK2 Pod System is equipped with a draw-activated firing mechanism, allowing for a chass