the refillable pods hold up to 3mL, and utilizes a juice viewing window to ensure a minimum fill level to prevent any dry hits or burning of the coil.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Caliburn X 20W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 107.4mm by 27.5mm by 15.6mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery: Integrated 850mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Range: 5-20W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJuice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOLED Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 3mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G\/G2 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm Caliburn G2 Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntelligent Resistance Detection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Power Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8s Vaping Overtime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn X\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn X Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Caliburn G Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Caliburn G2 Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673630777399,"sku":"U Cali X Pod System","price":4700.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_x_-_pod_system_-_screen.png?v=1747872205"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-a2-15w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn A2 15W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn A2 15W Pod System, featuring an integrated 520mAh battery, 15W maximum output, and uses the new 0.9ohm Caliburn A2 Pods. Constructed from durable aluminum alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn A2 Pod System encases an integrated 520mAh rechargeable battery. Delivering up to 15W output, the constant voltage output is stable and produces delicious flavor from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts. Outfitted with a LED battery life indicator light, the Caliburn A2 Pod System can be fired via button or draw-activated mechanisms, producing exquisite vapor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"uwell caliburn a2 pod system\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0480\/2061\/9416\/files\/caliburn_a2_infographic.jpg?v=1645221052\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell Caliburn A2 15W Pod System Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 110mm by 21.3mm by 11.7mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 520mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum Wattage Output: 15W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button - Draw or Button Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Life Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9ohm UN2 Meshed Coil Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-Liquid Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8S Timeout Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Circuit Prompt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Blue, Green, Black, Grey, Iris Purple, Orange\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\nIncludes:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn A2 Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.9ohm Caliburn A2 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673630842935,"sku":"U Cali A2 Pod System","price":3560.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_a2_-_pod_system_-_sample_-_all_colors.png?v=1747872213"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-gk3-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn GK3 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn GK3 pod kit is a pocket-friendly vape, ideal for new and seasoned vapers alike. It contains a built-in 900mAh battery, which offers plenty of vaping before needing to be recharged. Delivering a 5-25W power output range, the GK3 is a solid option for both MTL (Mouth To Lung) and RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) vaping. This kit is compatible with the refillable Caliburn G3 pods and two 2ml pods are also included to help get you started.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e900mAh Built-In Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e5-25W Output Range\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL And RDTL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInhale Activation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmart Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVariable Wattage Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml Refillable Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop-Filling Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe GK3 boasts single-button operation and you can get started with five quick clicks. When unlocked, vape by either pressing the button or just inhaling on the mouthpiece. The device’s smart, built-in chipset recognises your coil’s resistance and selects the best power output automatically, helping your pods last longer and removing the need for any guesswork. If you’re looking for extra customisation, you can also set a power level manually and discover your perfect vape. However you decide to vape, keep track of power and battery life easily with the GK3’s built-in OLED display.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Caliburn G3 pods hold up to 2ml of e-liquid and boast a simple top-filling design. Refilling your pod is as easy as lifting off the mouthpiece — you don’t even have to remove it from your device, cutting down on a lot of mess. Their built-in coil design saves you even more hassle, as you can just replace the whole pod when the coil inside needs changing. Want to switch between an RDTL and MTL inhale? Simply swap between the 0.6 Ohm and 0.9 Ohm pods, both of which will work best 50% VG e-liquids and higher PG vape juice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCaliburn GK3 Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.6 Ohm Caliburn G3 Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9 Ohm Caliburn G3 Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanyard\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673630875703,"sku":"U Cali GK3 Pod System","price":4850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/caliburn-gk3-kit-min.jpg?v=1747872218"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-a3-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Caliburn A3 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the \u003ca title=\"Caliburn vape\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/uwell\"\u003eCALIBURN vape \u003c\/a\u003eA3 Pods (2-Pack), featuring 2mL capacity, magnetic pod connection, and a top-fill system with a removeable mouthpiece.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eQuick Link:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Uwell Caliburn A3 Pod System\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a3-15w-pod-system\"\u003eUwell CALIBURN A3 Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell CALIBURN A3 Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConstruction: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill-System: Top-Fill - Removeable Mouthpiece\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Uwell CALIBURN A3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm CALIBURN A3 Pods (2-Pack)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm CALIBURN A3 Pods (2-Pack)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"1.0ohm","offer_id":42114924445751,"sku":"U Cali A3 Replace Pods - 1.0 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0.8ohm","offer_id":42114924478519,"sku":"U Cali A3 Replace Pods - 0.8 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_a3_refillable_pod_-_accessories_-_packaging.png?v=1747872827"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-a2-replacement-pods","title":"Uwell Caliburn A2 Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Caliburn A2 Replacement Pods, featuring a 2mL pod capacity, 0.9ohm meshed coil, and is equipped Pro FOCS technology.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell Caliburn A2 Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/replacement-pods\" title=\"Caliburn pod\"\u003eUwell Caliburn Pod\u003c\/a\u003e Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9ohm UN2 Meshed Coil Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake sure to properly prime each coils and pods before use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673637560375,"sku":"U Cali A2 Replace Pods","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_-_caliburn_a2_-_refillable_pods_-_accessories_-_box-min.png?v=1747872833"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g2-empty-cartridge","title":"Uwell Caliburn G2 Empty Pod (2 pcs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/uwell\" title=\"uwell caliburn\"\u003eUwell Caliburn\u003c\/a\u003e G Replacement Pods, a leakproof 2mL capacity refillable pod, delivering delicious flavor and vapor from your favorite eJuice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-pod-system\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G Pod System\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G 15W Pod System\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-coils\" title=\"Buy Uwell Caliburn G Coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell CALIBURN G Replacement Pods Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G Pod Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Fill Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0ohm Caliburn G Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41673637691447,"sku":"U Cali G2 Empty Pod (2 pcs)","price":1200.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g_pods_-_packaging_dc778e9c-783e-4510-8c87-b48895a5547e.png?v=1747872836"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the new Uwell CALIBURN G 15W Pod System, featuring a 690mAh battery, adjustable airflow system, and holds up to 2mL of eJuice or nicotine salts. Constructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn G is resistant to light falls and drops. Encasing a long-lasting integrated 690mAh battery, the CALIBURN G can deliver an all-day vape, outputting up to 18W of power. At the top is a magnetically attached 2mL refillable pod equipped with a leakproof top fill system, accommodating either nicotine salts or freebase eJuice. Operating off a dual firing system, the Uwell Caliburn G can fire using the single intuitive firing button or a useful draw-activated firing system, offering users more flexibility. In addition, the quick charge bottom Type-C USB Port will reduce the time spent charging, for plenty of full bodied vapor and flavor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0480\/2061\/9416\/files\/Uwell_Caliburn_G_Infographic.jpg?v=1633045207\" alt=\"uwell caliburn g pod system infographic\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUwell CALIBURN G 18W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 108.3mm by 22.5mm by 12.6mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 690mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax. Wattage Output: 18W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Different Airflow - MTL \u0026amp; DTL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntuitive Firing Button - Dual Firing System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Fill Cap\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm UN2-Meshed-H Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Rosy Brown, Green, Grey, Red, Black, Blue\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn G Kit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn Pod Cartridge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.8ohm UN2-Meshed-H Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 USB Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775202697271,"sku":"U Cali G Pod System","price":3300.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g_packaging.png?v=1752511386"},{"product_id":"caliburn-a3s-pods","title":"Caliburn A3S Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience enhanced vaping convenience with the Uwell Caliburn A3S Replacement Pods. Each pod boasts a 2mL refillable capacity, allowing you to enjoy your favorite eJuices without frequent refills. Crafted from durable PCTG material, these pods are built to last. The user-friendly side fill system makes refilling a breeze. These pods come with integrated 0.8ohm or 1.0ohm coils for exceptional flavor delivery. Thanks to the magnetic connection, swapping out these pods is quick and hassle-free.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConstruction: PCTG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill-System: Side Fill System\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: Integrated Coil\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComes in a pack of four (4)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"0.8 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41775207972919,"sku":"Cali A3S Replace Pods - 0.8 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"1.0 OHM MESHED","offer_id":41775208005687,"sku":"Cali A3S Replace Pods - 1.0 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-caliburn-a3s-replacement-pod-min_e7e1acd5-cb3d-4e8a-917c-80889a5670ec.jpg?v=1752511754"},{"product_id":"caliburn-explorer-replacement-pods","title":"Caliburn Explorer Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn Explorer pods are designed for use with the Caliburn Explorer kit only. Featuring a unique split-pod design, these pods can hold two different e-liquids and coils at once, which can be vaped separately or together. Compatible with Caliburn G \u0026amp; G2 coils, these pods will deliver your choice of MTL (Mouth To Lung) or RDTL (Restricted Direct To Lung) inhale.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRefillable Pods For Caliburn Explorer\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml E-Liquid Capacity – 1ml Per Side\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide-Filling Design\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/uwell\" title=\"Uwell Kenya\"\u003eCompatible With Caliburn G \u0026amp; G2 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuited To 50\/50 And High PG E-Liquids\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach half of a Caliburn Explorer pod requires its own coil and e-liquid. This allows you to swap between two different flavours and coil resistances, or even vape both at once. To refill, simply open up the rubber stoppers on each side of the pod. The compatible coils from the Caliburn G and G2 series (sold separately) work best when paired with 50% VG or high PG e-liquid.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 x Caliburn Explorer Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775215542327,"sku":"Cali Explorer Replace Pods","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-caliburn-explorer-replacement-pod-min.jpg?v=1752512527"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-az3-pod-kit","title":"Uwell Caliburn AZ3 Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn AZ3 vape kit is a pocket-friendly pod that’s ideal for on-the-go vaping and is designed with ease of use in mind. It’s powered by a built-in 750mAh battery and delivers up to 17W of power. The AZ3 is an ideal option for beginners or more experienced vapers who are simply looking for a discreet vape. Each kit comes complete with two refillable Caliburn A3 pods to help you get started.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact Refillable Pod Kit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e750mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C Fast Charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInhale Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMTL Vaping\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2ml Refillable Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBuilt-In Mesh Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks to inhale activation, there’s no need to deal with any buttons or menus, instead, you can just puff on the mouthpiece. Your device will then create a small amount of vapour for an MTL (Mouth To Lung) vape that feels like a cigarette. The built-in chipset recognises which pod you’ve selected and will automatically adjust the wattage, this means no guesswork and the perfect power level every time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Caliburn A3 pods can each hold up to 2ml of your favourite e-liquid and refilling them is very easy – take off the mouthpiece to reveal the filling port, you don’t even have to remove the pod from your kit. The built-in mesh coils will heat up your e-liquid faster for improved flavour and you won’t need to worry about messy coil changes either, as you can just replace the entire pod instead. We suggest pairing the pods with 50\/50 e-liquid or higher PG options.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease note: The Uwell Caliburn AZ3 kit does not include a USB-C charging cable, but you can buy a USB-C Cable separately.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContains:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUwell Caliburn AZ3 Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ca title=\"Uwell Caliburn A3 Replacement Pods\" href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a3-replacement-pods\"\u003e0.8 Ohm Caliburn A3 Refillable Pod\u003c\/a\u003e (Pre-Installed)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.0 Ohm Caliburn A3 Refillable Pod (Spare)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41875299565623,"sku":"U Cali AZ3 Pod Kit","price":4550.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/caliburn-az3-kit-min.jpg?v=1757721409"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g3-pro-35w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G3 Pro 35W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing the Uwell Caliburn G3 Pro 35W Pod System, featuring a dynamic full-screen display, 3mL magnetic pods, adjustable airflow, 35W MAX output, and Pro-FOCS Flavor Tech for an unparalleled vaping experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Caliburn G3 Replacement Pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-g3-replacement-pods\"\u003eCaliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-gpp-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell caliburn gpp pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn GPP Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExperience the perfect blend of precision, performance, and style with the Uwell Caliburn G3 Pro 35W Pod System, featuring a full screen display with dynamic UI, a first for the Caliburn product line. Crafted from durable zinc-alloy, this sleek device offers a max wattage of 35W and supports a resistance range of 0.4-0.9ohm. Its integrated rechargeable battery and USB Type-C charging ensure reliable power, while the 3mL magnetic pods with side-fill system and adjustable airflow switch provide convenience and customization. Featuring Pro-FOCS Flavor Tech for exceptional flavor and a clearview juice window for easy e-liquid monitoring, the kit includes two Caliburn G3 pods (0.4ohm and 0.9ohm) for versatile vaping. The Uwell Caliburn G3 Pro is the ultimate pod system for vapers seeking both functionality and aesthetics.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell \u003ca title=\"Caliburn Vape\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/uwell\"\u003eCaliburn Vape\u003c\/a\u003e G3 Pro 35W Pod System Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIMENSIONS: 123.5mm x 27.8mm x 16.8mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CONFIGURATION: Integrated Rechargeable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWATTAGE RANGE: MAX 35W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRESISTANCE RANGE: 0.4-0.9ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHASSIS MATERIAL: Zinc-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHARGING: USB Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CONNECTION: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CAPACITY: 3mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD MATERIAL: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFILL SYSTEM: Side-Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAIRFLOW: Adjustable Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Flavor Tech\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClearview Juice Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD SUPPORT: Caliburn G3 Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn G3 Pro 35W Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.4ohm Caliburn G3 Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.9ohm Caliburn G3 Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 USB Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41876300365879,"sku":"U Cali G3 Pro Pod System","price":5400.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g3_pro_pod_system_-_screen.webp?v=1757897079"},{"product_id":"caliburn-gpp-replacement-pods","title":"Caliburn GPP Replacement Pods","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Uwell Caliburn GPP Pods, featuring a 0.4-1.2ohm resistance, 3mL pod capacity, and shares cross-compatibility with the Caliburn G3 series and G3 Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Link