\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn GPP Replacement Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"0.4ohm GPP Pods","offer_id":41876300988471,"sku":"Cali GPP Replace Pods - 0.4 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0.6ohm GPP Pods","offer_id":41876301021239,"sku":"Cali GPP Replace Pods - 0.6 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"0.9ohm GPP Pods","offer_id":41876302168119,"sku":"Cali GPP Replace Pods - 0.9 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"1.2ohm GPP Pods","offer_id":41876302200887,"sku":"Cali GPP Replace Pods - 1.2 ohm","price":1850.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_gpp_replacement_pods_-_default.webp?v=1757898312"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g3-pro-koko-35w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G3 Pro Koko 35W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Uwell Caliburn G3 Pro KOKO Pod System, featuring a 1250mAh battery, 35W output maximum, adjustable airflow control, and delivers exceptional flavor from the Caliburn G3 Pods. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Uwell Valiburn vape g3 pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-g3-replacement-pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn G3 Pro KOKO is lightweight and portable, fitting neatly into the pocket, purse, or bookbag. Offering a restricted direct lung vaping style, the Caliburn G3 Pro KOKO is the next evolution of the legendary Caliburn line.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell \u003ca title=\"Caliburn vape\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/uwell\"\u003eCaliburn Vape\u003c\/a\u003e G3 Pro Koko 35W Pod System Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIMENSIONS: 85.15mm by 49.5mm by 19.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CAPACITY: 1250mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CONFIGURATION: Integrated Rechargeable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWATTAGE RANGE: 35W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHASSIS MATERIAL: Zinc-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDISPLAY SCREEN: 1.8\" TFT Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOPERATION: Dual Firing | Button or Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOUTPUT: Adjustable Wattage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHARGING: USB Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CONNECTION: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CAPACITY: 3mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD MATERIAL: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFILL SYSTEM: Side-Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAIRFLOW: Adjustable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn G3 Pro KOKO\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.4ohm Caliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.9ohm Caliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Charging Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41876303609911,"sku":"U Cali G3 Pro Koko Pod System","price":5590.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g3_pro_koko_35w_pod_system_-_screen.webp?v=1757899501"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g3-lite-25w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite 25W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite 25W Pod System, featuring an integrated 1200mAh battery, 25W maximum output, and delivering exceptional flavor from the compatible G3 Pods. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-g3-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G3 Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"Shop Nicotine Salts\"\u003eShop Nicotine Salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from lightweight materials, the Caliburn G3 Lite offers exceptional portability while remaining reliable and sturdy. Encapsulating a 1200mAh battery, \u003cem\u003ethe Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite can operate for 3 days before needing a recharge, based on internal tests by Uwell's Lab\u003c\/em\u003e. Forgoing a screen or any buttons, Uwell has relegated the full battery capacity to outputting delicious flavor and vapor from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/uwell\" title=\"Caliburn\"\u003eCaliburn Vape\u003c\/a\u003e G3 Lite 25W Pod System Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIMENSIONS: 111.4mm by 28.8mm by 16.3mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CAPACITY: 1200mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CONFIGURATION: Integrated Rechargeable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWATTAGE RANGE: MAXIMUM WATTAGE: 25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHASSIS MATERIAL: Lightweight Materials\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOPERATION: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOUTPUT: Continuous Voltage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHARGING: USB Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CONNECTION: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CAPACITY: 2.5mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD MATERIAL: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFILL SYSTEM: Side Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCOIL SUPPORT: Integrated Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAIRFLOW: Pod Based (Rotate Pod to Switch)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.6ohm Caliburn G3 Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41876307312695,"sku":"U Cali G3 Lite Pod System","price":3800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g3_lite_pod_system_-_space_black.webp?v=1757900573"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g4-35w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G4 35W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore the UWELL Caliburn G4 Pod System, boasting a 1300mAh battery, adjustable 5–35W output, animated display, and versatile Storm and Wave Modes for an elevated vape experience. Cross-compatible with the Caliburn G3 Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-gpp-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn GPP replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn GPP Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-g3-replacement-pods\" title=\"Caliburn g3 replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis sleek device is crafted from durable aluminum-alloy and supports a resistance range of 0.4–0.9ohm, optimized for smooth flavor and cloud production. Its magnetic 3mL pod system uses Caliburn GPP Series pods and a convenient side-fill design, ensuring both ease of use and secure handling. With an adjustable airflow switch and intuitive draw-activation, users can fine-tune every puff. Whether in Storm Mode for powerful clouds or Wave Mode for consistent output, the G4 balances cutting-edge features with compact portability, making it a top-tier choice for everyday vaping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/uwell\" title=\"Caliburn\"\u003eCaliburn\u003c\/a\u003e G4 35W Pod System Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIMENSIONS: 26mm x 15.65mm x 114.98mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CAPACITY: 1300mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CONFIGURATION: Integrated Rechargeable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWATTAGE RANGE: 5-35W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRESISTANCE RANGE: 0.4-0.9ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHASSIS MATERIAL: Aluminum-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDISPLAY SCREEN: Animated Display\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOPERATION: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOUTPUT: Adjustable Wattage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHARGING: USB Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CONNECTION: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CAPACITY: 3mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD MATERIAL: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD SUPPORT: Caliburn GPP Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFILL SYSTEM: Side-Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAIRFLOW: Adjustable Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStorm Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWave Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn G4 Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41876307935287,"sku":"U Cali G4 Pod System","price":5100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g4_pod_system_-_glacier_blue.webp?v=1757901909"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g4-mini-35w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G4 Mini 35W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop the Uwell Caliburn G4 Mini Pod System, offering an 1100mAh battery, 5-35W range, and a dual airflow system via pod orientation and adjustment slider. Featuring the new Caliburn GPP Pods and cross-compatible with the Caliburn G3 Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-gpp-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn GPP replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn GPP Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-g3-replacement-pods\" title=\"Caliburn g3 replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell Caliburn G4 Mini 35W Pod System Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIMENSIONS: 112.7mm by 24.1mm by 14mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CAPACITY: 1100mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CONFIGURATION: Integrated Rechargeable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWATTAGE RANGE: 5-35W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHASSIS MATERIAL: PC + PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOPERATION: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOUTPUT: Variable Voltage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHARGING: USB Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CONNECTION: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CAPACITY: 3mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD MATERIAL: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFILL SYSTEM: Side-Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCOIL INSTALLATION: Integrated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAIRFLOW: Side + Cartridge Orientation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eINCLUDES:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn G4 Mini\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.6ohm Caliburn GPP Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41876329988151,"sku":"U Cali G4 Mini Pod System","price":4500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g4_mini_pod_system_-_slate_grey.webp?v=1757902695"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-gz2-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn GZ2 Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Caliburn GZ2 17W Pod System, offering an 850mAh battery, 17W max output, and utilizes the Caliburn G2 Pods with Caliburn G Coils.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-empty-cartridge\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G2 Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G Coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell Caliburn GZ2 17W Pod System Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 68.9mm by 23.8mm by 23.6mm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 850mAh\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage: 17W\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Range: 0.8-1.0ohm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Aluminum-Alloy\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Draw-Activated\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: Caliburn G2 Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConstruction: PCTG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill-System: Top Fill System\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 GZ2 Device\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Caliburn G2 Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Caliburn Coils\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Caliburn G2 Coils\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 USB-C Cable\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42016207241271,"sku":"U Cali GZ2 Pod System","price":4500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_gz2_pod_system_-_black.webp?v=1765236468"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-explorer-32w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn Explorer 32W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Caliburn Explorer Pod System, offering an innovative dual sided cartridge, 32W max output, and integrated 1000mAh rechargeable battery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Uwell Caliburn Explorer Pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-explorer-replacement-pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn Explorer Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca title=\"Uwell Caliburn G2 Coils\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-replacement-coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G Coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable aluminum alloy, the Uwell Caliburn Explorer delivers outstanding flavor and performance, while ensuring a lightweight and portable form factor. Outfitted with a dual-sided cartridge, the Caliburn Explorer can hold 2mL on each side, accommodating those who love a variety of flavors without needing to change out the cartridge. Powered by an integrated 1000mAh battery, the Uwell Caliburn Explorer Pod System can last throughout the day without needing a recharge, but facilitates recharging via Type-C Port.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell CALIBURN Explorer 32W Pod System Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 128.1mm x 26mm x 14.6mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Aluminum-Alloy\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage: 32W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.8-1.2ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 1000mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Port: USB Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput: Variable Voltage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Directional Firing-Button Activation \/ Draw-Activation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Dual Side-Fill - Silicone Stoppers\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: Dual Sided 4mL (2mL per Side)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Plug 'n' Play\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Installation: Press-Fit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: G \/ G2 Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2-Sided Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSupports 2 Coils Simultaneously\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual-Flavor Immersion\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4-Leaf Clover Menu Button\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuper Wide ClearView Juice Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2A Type-C Charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Flavor Technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell CALIBURN Explorer Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell CAIBURN Explorer Pod (Preinstalled)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Meshed CALIBURN G Coil (Preinstalled)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm CALIBURN G2 Coil (Preinstalled)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Meshed CALIBURN G Coil (Spare)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm CALIBURN G2 Coil (Spare)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 USB Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42016231325751,"sku":"U Cali Explorer Pod System","price":4150.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_explorer_pod_system_-_black.webp?v=1765237187"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-tenet-16w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn Tenet 16W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn TENET 16W Pod System, featuring a 750mAh battery, rugged exterior design, and is compatible with Caliburn G\/G2 Coils and Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Uwell Caliburn G2 Pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-empty-cartridge\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca title=\"Uwell Caliburn G2 Coils\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g2-replacement-coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G2 Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g-replacement-coils\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G Coils\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G Coils\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable aluminum alloy, the Caliburn Tenet Pod System delivers a strong and impervious chassis, updating the sleek metal unibody design with a new rugged exterior. In addition, Uwell has introduced haptic feedback to make the Caliburn Tenet much more intuitive. Operating off dual firing modes, like its predecessors, the Caliburn TENET can be button or draw-activated, making vaping a breeze. Furthermore, the TENET can call upon the Caliburn G or G2 Pods and Coils to deliver outstanding flavor and vapor from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts and can adjust the airflow via pod based rotating dial.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell Caliburn TENET 16W Pod System Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 110.9mm by 25.1mm by 16.3mm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 750mAh\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax Wattage Output: 16W\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Material: Aluminum-Alloy\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging: Type-C Port\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOperation: Button \/ Draw Activated Firing\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Series: Uwell Caliburn G2 Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFill System: Top Fill\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 2mL\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Installation: Press Fit\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCoil Support: Uwell Caliburn G\/G2 Coils\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHaptic Feedback\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePRO-FOCS Technology\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eJuice Level Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn TENET\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Caliburn G2 Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm Caliburn G Coil\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm Caliburn G2 Coil\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42016243089463,"sku":"U Cali Tenet Pod System","price":4650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_tenet_pod_system_-_olive_green.webp?v=1765239336"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g4-pro-35w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G4 Pro 35W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out Uwell Caliburn G4 Pro 35W Pod System, offering an 1800mAh battery, 35W maximum output, and compatibility with the GPP and G3 Replacement Pods.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-gpp-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn GPP replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn GPP Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-g3-replacement-pods\" title=\"Caliburn g3 replacement pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUWELL CALIBURN G4 PRO 35W POD SYSTEM FEATURES:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIMENSIONS: 120.7mm by 30mm by 18.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CAPACITY: 1800mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CONFIGURATION: Integrated Rechargeable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWATTAGE RANGE: 35W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHASSIS MATERIAL: Aluminum | ABS | IML | PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDISPLAY SCREEN: 2.51\" Shatterproof Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOPERATION: Touchscreen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOUTPUT: Variable Wattage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHARGING: USB-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CONNECTION: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CAPACITY: 3mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD MATERIAL: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFILL SYSTEM: Side-Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAIRFLOW: Stepless Airflow Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDroplet Shaped E-Liquid Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with GPP and G3 Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eINCLUDES:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn G4 PRO 35W Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.4ohm GPP Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.6ohm GPP Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manuals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42024135131191,"sku":"U Cali G4 Pro Pod System","price":5699.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g4_pro_35w_pod_system_-_iron_grey.webp?v=1765938843"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g3-lite-koko-25w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite Koko 25W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite KOKO 25W Pod System, featuring a 1200mAh battery, active resistance detection, and holds up to 2.5mL within the pod. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-g3-replacement-pods\" title=\"Caliburn G3 Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCrafted from ultra-low weight materials, the Caliburn G3 Lite KOKO is a slimmed-down version, without sacrificing any performance. Eliminating any screens, the Caliburn G3 Lite KOKO preserves precious battery life for vaporizing your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUWELL CALIBURN G3 LITE KOKO 25W POD SYSTEM FEATURES:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIMENSIONS: 76mm by 49.6mm by 17.9mm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CAPACITY: 1200mAh\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CONFIGURATION: Integrated Rechargeable\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWATTAGE RANGE: 5-25W\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHASSIS MATERIAL: PC + ABS\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOPERATION: Draw-Activated\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOUTPUT: Intelligent Resistance Detection\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHARGING: USB Type-C\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CONNECTION: Magnetic\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CAPACITY: 2.5mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD MATERIAL: PCTG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFILL SYSTEM: Top Fill\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCOIL SUPPORT: ALL G3 Cartridges\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanyard Attachment Point\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite KOKO\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.6ohm Caliburn G3 Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42058743414839,"sku":"U Cali G3 Lite Koko Pod System","price":3999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g3_lite_koko_25w_pod_system_-_basalt_grey.webp?v=1768256421"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g4-pro-koko-35w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G4 Pro Koko 35W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Uwell Caliburn G4 PRO KOKO Pod System in Kenya, featuring up to 35W of power, a 2000mAh battery, smart touchscreen, and customizable output mode.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Caliburn GPP replacement pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-gpp-replacement-pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn GPP Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Uwell Caliburn G3 replacement pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-g3-replacement-pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlongside the Storm Mode for throat hits and Waves Mode for smoother flavor, the Customize Mode lets you tailor your hits and flavor to your liking. The first-ever KOKO touchscreen provides instant feedback, allowing you to switch output modes, adjust wattage, and more with a single tap, while featuring 5 Blind Draw UI themes to collect. Compatible with both Caliburn GPP and G3 pods, the G4 PRO KOKO gives you options.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUWELL CALIBURN G4 PRO KOKO 35W POD SYSTEM FEATURES:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIMENSIONS: 85.8mm x 50mm x 23mm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CAPACITY: 2000mAh\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CONFIGURATION: Integrated Rechargeable\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWATTAGE RANGE: 35W\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDISPLAY SCREEN: 2\" Touchscreen\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOPERATION: Draw-Activated\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHARGING: USB Type-C\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CAPACITY: 3mL\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD SUPPORT: Caliburn GPP \/ G3 Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFILL SYSTEM: Side-Fill\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCOIL INSTALLATION: Pre-Installed\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAIRFLOW: Adjustable\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStorm Mode | Waves Mode | Customize Mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn G4 PRO KOKO Device\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.4ohm Caliburn GPP Pod (3mL)\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.6ohm Caliburn GPP Pod (3mL)\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42058772611127,"sku":"U Cali G4 Pro Koko Pod System","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g4_pro_koko_35w_pod_system_-_coral_pink.webp?v=1768258514"},{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-ak2-15w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn AK2 15W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop Uwell Caliburn AK2 15W Pod System, featuring an integrated 520mAh rechargeable battery, 15W maximum output, and utilizes 2mL 0.9ohm UN2 Meshed Pods. Compatible with the Caliburn A2 Pods.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Caliburn A2 Pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2-replacement-pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Caliburn A2s pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-a2s-replacement-pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn A2S Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable aluminum alloy, the chassis of the Caliburn AK2 Pod System possesses a thin and portable profile that is perfect for those that are on-the-go, and are looking for a dependable vaping system. Utilizing a fast Type-C charging system, the Caliburn A2 Pod System can deliver vaping in as little as 35 minutes to charge the battery up to 95%. Equipped with a 2mL refillable pod, the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/uwell\" title=\"Caliburn\"\u003eCaliburn\u003c\/a\u003e AK2 utilizes 0.9ohm UN2 Meshed-H Coil Pods that deliver delicious flavor and vapor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell CALIBURN AK2 15W Pod System Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 67.9mm by 43.5mm by 11.8mm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 520mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMax. Wattage Output: 15W\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS Technology\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eE-Liquid Viewing Window\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanyard Attachment Point\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Battery Indicator Light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Mouthpiece Cover\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 0.9ohm UN2 Meshed-H Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8S Overtime Protection\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c